OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies harassing councillor
OL,4,Aonline
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fharassing a councillor on Facebook.
OL,9,FRoma Frisby, of Dalby Road in Melton
OL,10,FMowbray, Leicestershire, appeared at
OL,11,FLeicester Magistrates' Court on
OL,12,FWednesday charged with harassment
OL,13,Fwithout violence.
OL,15,FCourt documents allege Frisby, 47,
OL,16,Fpursued a course of conduct amounting
OL,17,Fto harassment of Leigh Higgins, who
OL,18,Fserves as a councillor at Melton
OL,19,FBorough Council.
